    "        'Peor dia historico observado (2020-2024)',\n",
    "        'Peor ventana 30 dias historica observada (2020-2024)',\n",
    "        'Peor ventana 60 dias historica observada (2020-2024)',\n",
    "        'Peor ventana 90 dias historica observada (2020-2024)',\n",
    "    ],\n",
